{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30015_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:67d2f4fd9c2279aa162f45079c8bfd8d86b106ea25ded1d18b1759c6e0750976",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:463cced9ad84ca56c24fe77e9a780459388108b93b764addf11398dc268d858d",
      "text": "我们歌唱的理由",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a8ae72fe42f88b676ded396357c09418abb2159fe27e79f0d0b706f171f7f7",
      "text": "Altessimo的两人收到了某部舞台剧的\n出演邀约。被“转生到没有音乐的\n异世界的两位音乐家”这一设定吸引的两人，\n完成了锻炼体能的训练，迎来了正式演出……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000015:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000015:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:463cced9ad84ca56c24fe77e9a780459388108b93b764addf11398dc268d858d",
      "text": "我们歌唱的理由",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f6b13481c3281ab88bfebe4949773c98f81fc4ccd8a71bdaa63b5c5fb7928fb",
      "text": "……好的，OK！非常感谢二位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e0a73770cebf44e65d4d92706cf74d4be70b28f0aa339c0b4b9c75d56dcc17",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n……也谢谢大家。有缘再见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:565a945e0d6240f7e265d09cb1865564536d2ca8f51d019e97df2d92b5c46bb0",
      "text": "谢谢你们听我们唱歌。\n那么，再见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cb9a86c7ab91b7e6804886f84c0de3282d0e3293c4f47472e0efa4c8e55ee6",
      "text": "都筑先生，我们走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ed09f8754bf6d6bc915fc50798e4aca26956156c5db0f8e387a6e993bed4323",
      "text": "丽先生、圭先生，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82191a3c1d79f2f41720b5144f872e09afb92ef57e2351cf682739014ecc2dae",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n两位唱得真棒呢～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce445360537e40b0765f49e3d73bad005741aa608dd848e88937a40ba4efb7bd",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d78f9d4c2f42708458288b8197219094887a88371c0a1f241ae76702e533fce",
      "text": "不用客气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a42946b46e3ae3c5eb725c42fe9935e44fe22f9c347fee54adba79fd2486835b",
      "text": "唔。那两个人，真让人在意啊。……啊，你。能告诉我\n刚才唱歌的那两人组的名字和所属事务所吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1913cec87e3c32da89a692ede634d619c9e8386054d7305a57ddd27ff382a8cc",
      "text": "好的。组合名字叫Altessimo。\n是所属315 Production的偶像哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0971ec09dadb8a9460f9cc02c48f3bb037a10defce66e4e4383e1d7c34ffe36d",
      "text": "偶像吗。原来如此，谢谢你。\n那两个人真不错呢。真想见个面聊聊看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0edfc213b2c45a845881a59b62f0d67bcfd80065792d9df654ba0c95eb6ba4a2",
      "text": "休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374b5183565aac306b795931e5ce7fb9fdbe66ca38578b78f4203181c64eee8f",
      "text": "刚才音乐节目的录制，正如导播先生\n所说的那样，发挥得完全无可挑剔哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9af006447280dcca2e99003bd6d5a95fb0717de005895124a045a28d911d9837",
      "text": "周末公布出演名单真让人期待呢。粉丝各位\n也一定会感到高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb860772483614e5145fff149fafb7fcb0673df24b850e651127e3617f751a0",
      "text": "啊，是啊。\n大家都会听吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa9e982961b39542648d1e2639c19d1fa22f9845773dd2d1666ee9664c3faaa1",
      "text": "大家都会听的哦。\n在舞台上不也是那样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b172a98b63b6ccdc41167ddc6931a4acc4eee2087f2c0c6964a606f0ef8487c",
      "text": "是的，确实如此呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f714f5d9afa4177eb49afa1dad91ded96a840f34946b6f1ef5d0d3810909670a",
      "text": "不过说起来，仅仅是上了个电视，\n就会变得这么忙碌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8456d67c4efcc8c4ea2248d3229d957f3b7997a99a60a2d108ce5e902958a1ae",
      "text": "是的，唱歌以外的工作也明显增多了。\n那些方面我们也想好好努力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cf23a51850728938806cafd6ab3ce83258c3bc8033fa947e3d5c33643bcdcc",
      "text": "我也会努力跑业务，\n争取拿到两位想要尝试的工作的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000057:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce6e72544d70f649e2e21da0051ac7515e5f7158088c79bded3c59bcfe83708a",
      "text": "（……嗯？舞台剧的出演邀约？\n是给Altessimo两位的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5939c70bc7698a18ba897ef97d552a8bce10e5719924341015c18b609b0382a",
      "text": "得赶快联系两位才行……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fba3ffbb76bd0c2cdf51e78042e9191b571fd0d0d99d173c4bf24c504215e0c",
      "text": "对台本当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5203601cb4f11e167e1c1dc7a057a44dcebe3d08aa706d7e8d34aab116124e53",
      "text": "这位就是这次向我们发出邀约的剧作家先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fafdf89c8be07eaf00a8a66f33eabefd0900271df90d2ec105fd47397ac6c9",
      "text": "初次见面，我是Altessimo的神乐丽。\n请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b03764919bb35937eb1b018823ba917b7387feb8645f3ae5a670083e50ba185",
      "text": "我也是Altessimo的都筑圭。请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc9947690883b508fee7d01d43757a62100f589368929191ff295cad34f43022",
      "text": "我才是。今天能见到二位很高兴。你们\n录制音乐节目的录影棚，我也在场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2006e9fa75b16c5f44fff37ea448293eb6e541f24a737fa82f1c7e10f54b34e3",
      "text": "在那里听到了《Tone's Destiny》。\n让我得到了新舞台剧的灵感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ed58bb81f44f299c0bec840baddea7602cbb48504d1c2ef1c4d3fcc67e9e20e",
      "text": "听了我们的歌……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b13be0a0637230ee546710982820eafec7ada0466bffaa0e73f8b23cf7ffb32e",
      "text": "哎～居然还有这样的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a649eb99db900d9255f29d4300b0df42cea587a72cccb9bcfd9b0f1ab39adc2",
      "text": "我希望能接下这份工作。Altessimo的\n两位有什么疑问吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c586c07fc5d00fae62f3018827f8c93f81ef4157aec438493df4c3c411b89f47",
      "text": "怎么说呢……坦白讲，虽说感到惊讶，\n但能以我们的歌为契机，真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0782b7830f7fcb78e28a94b53b6b34c71fd8456b411da599eab57efd5e85227",
      "text": "我非常想接受这份邀约。\n您觉得可以吗，都筑先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad408dbc676653b176323cbdf01c6ef095f080a2224ebf07ae1edebb2801256",
      "text": "嗯。\n虽然不知道我能不能做好，但我想试一试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4154751298a0f7d6c903c5cfe930cf647c9dd3af2c9cc6df3db154e5e6f2e78a",
      "text": "而且我也很想知道，从我们的歌声中，\n究竟诞生出了什么样的故事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000078:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000088:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:757a88dde6b4fb1fc0d368648ed1a702097bb8c2782d8a244291042cb7e65aa3",
      "text": "……辛苦了，是我。\n突然打电话给你，非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000090:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4dd7396808a7ff09295122732b6085f4274bfb167eb2d230ad61927660d376b",
      "text": "虽然听说你还在外头，\n但我想就这次的工作和你稍微谈一谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000092:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff7a151bc3246c0d6356d6bbbf48eabeef8d6a309948b43370aa2e1d7fde8ad9",
      "text": "要谈的事，就是关于今天那部舞台剧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000094:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcdccc7a5adf2305c3ad113f41a4bb533dfd4712210dd546b475cd92953095a2",
      "text": "就在你说要努力之后，马上就为我们带来了\n新工作的话题呢。我很感谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000096:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd99ebbe11b562eb0ddd122d9c2c25f0a88a4beb342efe4c1f9d44a7aad8e54",
      "text": "接着，接下来才是正题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000098:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3571b8b6906398254f2cd5f7c1f69a83356a130ebadd6be4b25c3646e8bbe2ba",
      "text": "之后正式的舞台排练一旦开始，\n也许会因为我不习惯而给你添麻烦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000100:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d9a31099c31ee2ff5e9576cc576a0eced9c318ce28f277c6e60c8f79c28bf63",
      "text": "虽然我会努力避免那样，\n但这次也能拜托你协助我们吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000102:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f26293ae977aad99865db832d30e7fb70de6f96d42cae73db8a1df03c28b6c0",
      "text": "当然了，这次我也\n会全力支持的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000105:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94330b0a76c1ba8d30b80e2e0b563f27328b6329b6f6e227999d79eebc514940",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n听到你这么说，我就安心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000107:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e02eaeef352a99268e95c8e4a1616018f535bcdc3bb03e0f2506de8e3e85cb6",
      "text": "为了不辜负你的期待，我会努力的。\n那么明天起，就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:761ad08f696c2a586ce3d9d5b72252cdd2a66d8ad0a39556fea9eee5b9f04977",
      "text": "天气这么好真是太好了呢。\n是个绝佳的跑步好天气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50df93606f985a91e36821fab678c017470812f543c69f95c5d405519b228584",
      "text": "嗯。\n阿尔托从出门开始就特别开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90345df9ded223feb777e6d3ae0049ace28a02a520643abfe561cdfb99e5a28c",
      "text": "哎呀，阿尔托。\n难道说，你想和我一起跑吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2e9843f1ae2ed4571c5751a0ae9039314f40d81f781ad5fa1977e02e3fb77a7",
      "text": "看起来是的。都筑先生，\n可以请你和阿尔托一起跑吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c912ec639261ef16e34bca350e70c2de4e3df298a956b88e15159ab40873cb9",
      "text": "好啊。阿尔托，今天请多关照啦。\n要是我累了，能拉着我跑的话我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b900f7222584234cdb670f7e5c070099e2514d3079e1f09a53c0f6c0cdb29f2d",
      "text": "两位都请多加小心。\n到了休息时间我会通知你们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a61afb1d524bba1ba8cad245a6b987f504f734738765f059d9e6c0061559bd69",
      "text": "……哈啊、哈啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:488e775e357a0ca19db99754c0e60d93e5ac3be77a6ae320dda461077ca04231",
      "text": "（……呼吸稍微有些急促了。\n不知道都筑先生怎么样了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1dab9779b5b58f71a7fdebd625bc768e5427884b263dc4a59d9264c34f53984",
      "text": "……咦，人呢！？都、都筑先生！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:486f6cf066eddaa3cce0d8767d40bbd0252187e1ee76d06e7fded30bfc9a8c78",
      "text": "对不起。我有点累了。刚才在跟制作人\n和阿尔托一起休息呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e443fb82f90a1eaa3208d2664ec7abcc14553be99e4c23fc8411b0433e586a8",
      "text": "都筑先生，您才刚动了没一会儿哦。\n……不，能跑到这里也算是有进步了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8240014a69a0eea4de8bf0f487d3c791411383f7ebb3c16842fca21cee9bee4",
      "text": "他已经非常努力了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:884e003fdda9b33dc3800d9ce61bb98d57f13998a1656902567cad5f53b24ab6",
      "text": "都筑先生，在习惯之前先试着快走怎么样？\n光是走路，也是有效果的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6dc72c0367494ea1b789ffd84906d154aaf8bc4fb3f24572255fbc65a018825",
      "text": "那挺不错的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:166ff95213ab198fb93d381726f925a6b7e78503a8621378d843d27d1cf8420f",
      "text": "要跟上丽先生跑步的速度虽然很难，\n但如果是步行的话，感觉就能跟得上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:519f4fc6f661f136896f78a2802108cb2bbe43b1c00f887a9ae8a6eeceb3537c",
      "text": "汪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_d:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a528337441154fcdf03ab5481ac6005a4d7ed03b824d5fb2cece1018c04159b",
      "text": "阿尔托也在给都筑先生加油吗？\n呵呵，是吗。那我们就一起走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42a44bf334c1d8b1fc7eb1b775adb3fc44c22d32fbb6b65ac40cfc284ef1c855",
      "text": "剧本送到了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bd9b5ea4e0c94f31f913dbf5f0531f6a459a2e918c7912fc6141c6df4c6d7cb",
      "text": "这就是这次舞台剧的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dcce4b83da9044f32a574696c7946f460d22c44bb0b09b37a2dcecd19365e28",
      "text": "是的。听说主题是《转生到没有音乐的异世界、\n两名音乐家的奇幻故事》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:882abb7c377726a0bb21f2bc2576821b247e4b3578b1a41d021540bc1013195d",
      "text": "真好奇是个什么样的世界呢。\n我们赶紧读读看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f3cd364ed99af72610e5f8104a7eb8be7222272344b6a9415a20094bc15925e",
      "text": "……呼。原来如此，是把我们的歌曲\n改编成了这样的故事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bfe406b05f484cf955ba5ceeefb1667820cf1cadb952b7772ea08e7b5863301",
      "text": "没有音乐的世界，吗……\n在这之前，还真从来没有想过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6e64ac3ef33874346b5f2fa1487596897dafc15dcb9ffbe9016f2ad50177820",
      "text": "我也是。\n连想象都不曾想象过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efd75d741001a144ca9e4f4d4e3d96ebe4f8d8df3e040141ce88ade34d7d9f4c",
      "text": "但是，心理描写刻画得非常细腻，\n感觉已经能理解那是个怎样的世界了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1db63ebc55f6a0d2b0cb6bac06ed27099340cd50de1028f6db55857b75f16097",
      "text": "嗯。由我们来把它传达给大家吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55",
      "text": "好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa3a6264e63fcd3e5f6846cf5474607478bb180c1a55de26d3f47c94d453ed9a",
      "text": "某个训练日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d33033b2ed70c41fa9f82ce74b7d53dc906933531ad0d4b5c7aacb05414f3566",
      "text": "呼……跑得真痛快呢。\n稍微，休息一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:475be08fd8f91dc2180659aa4b6da4961b01b50a4b67d9a98ca93fa59b8674d6",
      "text": "辛苦了，给您水。\n不介意的话请用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e0b8a523dce367faa4b2cacf8af4e6fce2398b767caa3e9206a19310bff5e1f",
      "text": "谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:929b28572e8de2333a470232c81a4c083b53e2381ce4da4cff60a5a0cdbe2e67",
      "text": "都筑先生喝水的量比起吃午饭还要多\n呢。肚子不会饿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0723490bcaaad59277a838a6317b38e56b13dbcc0d9b6fa4df14e03d6ff41091",
      "text": "没事的哦。我只要有水就够了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7b48f4e21de83825de298a7b7a26cd94dc0e2e64db5d290df952f432b6ba0e4",
      "text": "就我而言，\n要是能多吃一点的话会更安心就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bee15261103b75c1a6cea164760d8fd80a9ae3be69baac595dc4030eb435f12e",
      "text": "呵呵，我猜到你会这么说，\n所以喝了比平时更多的水，没问题的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e001eddb4a2dc6b4c23e2e36ebae444b6421f67f4b1f95f5d2eeba474630eab5",
      "text": "不是，这不是一回事吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6916cc0230b923a33ac1298a3d425b8551a1b56f00c21c04acf07357e9eaafa",
      "text": "哈哈，从听说二位是原音乐家偶像那时起，\n到现在对二位的印象改变了好多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b14b0059d46152ab4e13f449b28f278a5e427be76e23c6b9b160d6ef2723e4a",
      "text": "没想到是这么有意思的人。为了能\n打造出一场精彩的舞台，一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:804977e73b68c0f47d1b409a372ac0d80d6bdc6c2a6e22bdd07bb56e57bac8d5",
      "text": "公演首日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:078536554053dc6f0b17cb42d6280e8e190a0eb0379bcb84047b164cac4aab6c",
      "text": "客人们的表情都很欢欣呢。能够强烈\n感受到他们对今天的期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc112635a711da624f8c7e6cdc070bb9d5b299af733a7930d03778e9ed9c7ab",
      "text": "观众一进场，会场的氛围就不一样了啊。\n……切实感受到了大家的期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10d9d5a9e837c9aae67141ed3e785abc8dc20b561b1ae62ace16f22ad32d8ac5",
      "text": "丽先生，紧张起来了呢。\n只要和平常一样发挥就没问题的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc142d30bb1ba1d7ef2cd96e581291b05c4d72491d47b39917fa1eb507cea268",
      "text": "剧团的粉丝们\n也很期待两位的出演哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b73fbaf66bb5c7058bfbf0db2aa6f7c80abcd50dece1424a23fb2ffb10b3a51c",
      "text": "而且今天Altessimo的粉丝各位，\n也有很多人前来看剧呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0237eefaa53913e5307275b03975bf5908e0845bff0c1b362a6841e2572ab1f4",
      "text": "有人听了我们的歌，\n像这样把它编织成了一出戏剧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d715454523c43859a893dec126594768dcd72ee1bdc90b3599df68a03ace3fc5",
      "text": "歌曲能够化作另一种形式传递给粉丝，\n偶像真的很不可思议呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45877f74aa10901630b5c23b750d96b3a12e34ba34609feb38a8a441f5c3dfe9",
      "text": "都筑先生……\n……嗯，说得对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f56dfdf4a5840c0dd93733331f190a289518b80832ba9d85d04530ed1c7510c1",
      "text": "“这个世界里，没有音乐。对于对第二人生\n陷入绝望的我来说，那次相遇简直是奇迹”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31e1432f6605269b76c6596cce33ff6db4b69258f0dba820faeee31482e857ed",
      "text": "“……你，为什么能唱歌呢！？\n在这个世界里，理应是没有音乐的才对”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b798a8aafdef5c7ef82713d2320fff12bdee3950376ad4e3bb770c42128f467f",
      "text": "“你才是，为什么会知道歌唱呢？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:713c4cf636edf6de60d00478d0f7353c823ef84791c950232b94b60b3f71756d",
      "text": "“其实我并不是这个世界的人。\n原本生活在一个拥有音乐的世界里”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8184b28d2468857be64eda3a3f19c2d951232387c734815f77faf79f23560199",
      "text": "“对于从小为了成为声乐家而接受培养的我来说，\n音乐是理所当然的存在”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a27186d67f93163a05f5214ea0cce8fe523f0f9af1b8dc65a5be3f96b26872e2",
      "text": "“某一天，我因意外失去了生命……\n等回过神来，就已经在这个世界了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eca8f8911fd6d6c91ca930593f15c703527c8ee292ad6cbde46b8d8d6d452189",
      "text": "“我也一样哦。曾经是个不起眼的音乐老师。\n某一天，不小心从楼梯上踩空了呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76c833d327fc51b1762455e2984361104535c5ab0667dcd2570639198c72ef7d",
      "text": "“……不小心，吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a2e6def86e87c0e352279a04918d0a703bd8ffc90fb1e79a3dcfeacd19d622",
      "text": "“嗯。但是，没想到还能再次听到\n谁的歌声，真的让我很惊讶哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:602b5a35780ba2691a97410621d010aa8f85caaa1db0a8a1aa049c31a105d54a",
      "text": "“你听过这首歌吗？这是我最喜欢的曲子”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca3d9dafeea9e5dd13a7940e0fdacb1b8f83dd442622b5f50b3f2f06077cb8aa",
      "text": "“谢谢你陪我一起唱歌。\n今天真的非常开心哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ed8c5ad231b1da86aea0bd38a8fb1ed98ac5d26ac3899c254530a640abde4d1",
      "text": "“我也是。唱歌，居然如此快乐……\n能产生这样的想法，真的是久违了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e47bf6d8b39c47a35eb27a4ae62b973c52d38cac87e8be2d32fb7a3f75dcf50",
      "text": "“在来到这里之前，唱歌成了理所当然的事……\n几乎只剩下了惯性”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8e487e0319a9d8c8956a61be3555218f45f37d6dbb7a981e5cdeeb63ddc8773",
      "text": "“看来你也乐在其中，真是太好了。\n明天我也在这里等你”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_h:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:959dd899913ccffc441cf7d2edd2a822fc62c589035794299155da1c622aba2c",
      "text": "“……好的！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2105a0c688b3931e6399d61da549a0ad4f98a6f786713ef27015e6cd30c6669",
      "text": "“呐。听说近期会举办王子的生日宴会呢。\n我们能在那里表演我们的歌声吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d3d1dbde5ca328106d964816e6ad2969d94e901d804fc172a12c6b350c0951c",
      "text": "“在、在王子的生日宴会上！？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:759fc221c7429c06448289e7ab64bd29710204ec03e1e71e1ad29f5fe884d2fd",
      "text": "“这个世界的人根本不知道什么是歌！\n惊吓到大家，搞不好会被判大不敬罪的！？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94944c2fd97182bd0fb5612f6aba42250d5f7ae5854b43888be1ef75c32cc4d7",
      "text": "“不会有那种事的。美好的事物，\n就是美好的。就算是王子，也一定会理解的”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:640ae3da8c1d49721d41f0c6343363e657cc52187e89e652a42932cc4e2910b0",
      "text": "“还是说你觉得，我们的歌并非如此？\n你以前，都是怀着这种想法在歌唱的吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8e6d1926c300dc9098dd49c394218a4d7d8c3545e720cc3bbe94e6767b3f3a1",
      "text": "“不、不是的。我……\n……我，很开心”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:651ca6b63e9a7c1c89a490ddb57f33169572ae0691a0c0fb5b653bdc30b98553",
      "text": "“在这个谁都不知道音乐的世界里，与你两个人\n自由地歌唱，让我感到快乐得无法自拔”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:182dff112ecf0093bdfccaa86ed789cc401b7a7625a614d0e9759ee189118b0e",
      "text": "“现在我终于明白了。音乐的快乐，以及它的美丽”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:349454d92f1f695b7ffba05af950577ebbf5d9d0b183b9158dac771340147f4c",
      "text": "“嗯，就是这样呢。从你的歌声和表情里，\n我充分感受到了‘快乐’的心情哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4878edef380b4ceb8a36dca1384911750d0887258507329ce9703b4cd86d5a6",
      "text": "“……是的。我曾以为自己再也\n无法歌唱了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:753bfaa8b2ab5c38cba732838679469044908d079f25caa95121a1c96ec4bc23",
      "text": "“正因为如此，或许才会觉得快乐吧。\n正因一度失去过，才注意到了重要的事物”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21e69b4fd1c35c9f81bfabc86df8f6d064d17cc45366204c3ecb449dc1520b34",
      "text": "“在这个世界唯二懂得音乐的两人得以相遇。\n若仅仅让这份奇迹以奇迹告终，未免太可惜了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50fb444bca5ce08689d96587367224c6a3a13180f7566760acd23efe08121ff1",
      "text": "“就让我们两人一起，把音乐的喜悦传递给大家吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646885be06b5701d43189d59b5b70872bbb05eefc9c649a18dc2000e668d3ef5",
      "text": "丽先生、圭先生。辛苦了！\n真是一场无可挑剔的精彩舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceb6e5fe674412844ae5aca03bb86263639e20199f574085e924696eb90dad5f",
      "text": "调查问卷的反馈中，\n两位的演技也大受好评哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee8db3ddc42367b21c0362273576e24980ec6ccce9df44a86593bb7bf8723c99",
      "text": "这样吗。那真是太好了。在表演的时候，\n我完全没有余力去注意观众席呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4424b2b8c0ed14cfd43c702d28605ad6ae66cc17bcc84e307f7d35dd69d7ece8",
      "text": "我也是情感过于代入角色，\n甚至都忘记了这只是一场戏呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c3f288d2ce788d3ddb986346f03c01cf9babf144080fdd0ed5fdc17c6c92f4",
      "text": "那份心意，一定传达给各位观众了！\n接下来也请继续努力，直到千秋乐吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000044:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd2fb06c93178c72f654868e657887d11d933f1a9daa9e15bbf8bf0e5dc2db2",
      "text": "千秋乐当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17ccfcb896412dc7f4efba3848f2ebfe162a8b73ffae8180e2e4efdaf630e672",
      "text": "公演期间，真的非常快乐呢。\n有了各种各样的发现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b988643e49da6ed8b668acd14ba5f1cd29b88399af015223c2c8f89839a9d3",
      "text": "或许是因为感受到了和扮演的角色同等程度的、\n拥有音乐的喜悦吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04a8424162df320defcc77dc8bb77165ab53687229cd488a5be0d2a0444f482a",
      "text": "没有任何一人掉队，\n迎来了千秋乐，我感到无比欣喜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edcacdfc10d5a2678d0cb6dc4399697157b136624eaea159b6c13977f9a23ff7",
      "text": "最后有一首歌想让大家听一听。\n那是这部舞台剧初始的歌曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f458303927c5c05e2bbb465aab2d7e31035a0227a42f6c6fc465cc31ef1f1ba9",
      "text": "请听吧。这首曲子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000103:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000110:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae40db7ce3c48a48653c053956fd03558bddfb8fed4294e488c763b9ab7e296",
      "text": "千秋乐，辛苦大家了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000112:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c259f988525a0816ba77602dbdcb1caf4662dbb6a46cdaee66cd1bcadc6815d2",
      "text": "等到一切结束，\n真是一眨眼的功夫呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000114:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f09d5e0942e2fad572b8e205b5398a7e3f58e6b7ad39bc127ff6367a55675c79",
      "text": "真的\n是这样呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000116:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65742721e166edc68e9ce964d088d877a48aa3d7e0a8c83b39547edc5f96c943",
      "text": "听到说想\n打造一部舞台剧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000118:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca10756feab33dc79f4f19891e93f1ab9d5aa6b9bdc6041ef9bff25518d80d99",
      "text": "就仿佛是昨天的事一样啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000120:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30dae3ae9cfabc0121a7307a3375e8c589a72dc79ef09ba3638011868740cb76",
      "text": "这正说明我们彻底沉浸其中了，\n是这样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000122:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a97d2bc532c20d2a883a779907e711c19912e9db36c818cb2f37ff72f3cca41",
      "text": "是啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000124:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:657d2eda37100848909060fa76b5eef479cfc282a07b1d5a6a8884845e1e8b5f",
      "text": "度过了非常\n充实的\n日子呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000126:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1099f3d5979f6f71af79d33e27aa64f21258cf464059da54504e4487e2f45b5d",
      "text": "毕竟大家在练习上\n都非常努力呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000126:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a06e944b619e54eaddea5efd39ecfa739b7c300a5dce9697130475b22f5d9d",
      "text": "毕竟两位在练习上都很努力呢。\n能够展现出那样的成果\n真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000127:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:affd1a4dce18d6e8890abd76c202ad04394f2b4964e9729dc30f5fcd6cd16cb3",
      "text": "能让那么多人感到高兴\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000127:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abfd9b4adb113c92612dfc03ef302e14f0794d32aaeb1935cf15383c53db87d0",
      "text": "能让那么多人感到高兴真是\n太好了！这就是两位\n努力付出的结果呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000131:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fb8c4c9213e0e60c28c5d84f5e6d72470754ad4a370f30f3a065fbb1e4106a8",
      "text": "嗯\n成了很好的经验呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_j:cmd-000133:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b76d8747022d6c9e68df35cd143e42a5ede0402f188a392b879090bf9de4225",
      "text": "我不会忘记这份经验，\n今后也想继续向着\n新的工作发起挑战。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fb1254575f6351d0097d1c2bc1bd9149c26918f8a8c65e54d61aa43572d106",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n今天的工作也完成得无可挑剔呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd8b134b23619303a1e61cb2712746fb5fd48e2f65af278e31925dff18e9891",
      "text": "感觉两位\n总觉得变得更加强壮结实了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:decd4fd60d22b7b37b45e61c69623a4d84e0fc5aac7596502ee29cb3555075c6",
      "text": "强壮……是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43180d373454a23f10e9da906983e506c05c6d9f18d00e6705439bcbdd06a785",
      "text": "为了和丽先生一起锻炼体力，\n走了很多路……也许是多亏了那个吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d205d94d903284a692d639148ee6c0ffc3abf3cac44cc6408cb4f2914668ec",
      "text": "虽然只有一点点，\n但也已经能和丽先生一起跑起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ba78d3df54aa38ed084701e97c62d52793c2be1e325f219c2ad18fd01d93f27",
      "text": "我想制作人说的\n应该不是那个意思吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c933fd2cdc02349b8044f5b130e555a74df605c4be9d142f66127fb61851109",
      "text": "但是，单看体力方面，\n确实也展现出了变化。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08ffcb759eff118399e3d47bb8afa76f80a5809cfe6db84ead2948e8ed9c28c8",
      "text": "这正说明我们确实有所成长了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:943e7af2d1fb52681fa4b1b175c175a823edf81434485dca0d2bff51ca9044d2",
      "text": "能帮上那份忙，我感到非常高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e74e115ae9c9bbbdbdb280193cd4cacac9866930bb8af42854ee4995e0af1d30",
      "text": "是因为和你们两人聊了很多吗？\n感觉今天胃口好像比平时更好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfd2959e7bd9fe70c068c553dbe131d8373afda396ed962ec35ebc50aa54b157",
      "text": "呵呵，那我们就动身去餐馆吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e10209d002b200ff05ffc7332fde6929a4b1dcd0e153711e9677c8e79e056ab",
      "text": "都筑先生，可不要勉强自己吃太多哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_k:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bed7bdf2c591cc2b42510e75c9fb172fb9df6bd95f78ba8fb779bbe2d366d27",
      "text": "嗯。我知道了。\n谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
